  "jei.title.drying": "曝乾術",
  "lsp.flowerbook.text": "是書玄奧，出於古墟，帛簡雖歷千年，猶存完璧，盡錄草木之理。",
  "lsp.flowerbook.title": "芳譜",
  "lushscentedparadise.no_heated.text": "未烹",
  "message.lushscentedparadise.toggle_auto_pickup": "自攝：%s",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.abyssal_brew.text1": "匿形而缓行",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.americano.text1": "清冽美咖，暫提神氣。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.arcana_tea.text1": "汲盡吾身靈慧，當教金雨漫天！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.astragalus_soup.text1": "黄耆数匙粥，赤箭一瓯汤。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.axolotl_tea.text1": "南有嘉鱼，烝然罩罩。君子有酒，嘉宾式燕以乐。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.bak_kut_geh.text1": "捐軀赴國難，視死忽如歸",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.black_tea.text1": "曾经沧海难为水，除却巫山不是云。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.blue_oc_tea.text1": "余既滋兰之九畹兮，又树蕙之百亩。畦留夷与揭车兮，杂杜衡与芳芷。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.brilliant_amethyst_drink.text1": "呼兒將出換美酒，與爾同銷萬古愁",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.brownsugar_milktea.text1": "赤糖温香，可暖丹田",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.burdock_soup.text1": "见说五湖供饮马，沧浪何处着渔舟。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.cactus_tea.text1": "今夜不知何处宿，平沙万里绝人烟。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.cappuccino.text1": "浮雪盈盞，滑若凝脂。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.caramel_macchiato.text1": "琥珀流芳，增福緣之數。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.celestial_extract.text1": "夜半凝神，徐徐补益",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.chocolate_lily_tea.text1": "众里寻他千百度。蓦然回首，那人却在，灯火阑珊处。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.chocolate_milktea.text1": "可可浓醇，醺然欲醉",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.chorus_tea.text1": "莫愁前路無知己，天下誰人不識君",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.coffee_milktea.text1": "咖啡醒神，牛乳润体",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.cold_brew.text1": "冷淬其華，柔順倍之。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.coral_mint_sparkling_water.text1": "相逢秋月满，更值夜萤飞。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.cornflower_tea.text1": "仿佛媳婦輕雲之蔽月，飄搖兮若流風之回雪",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.dandelion_tea.text1": "彼采萧兮，一日不见，如三秋兮，",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.enchanted_supreme_golden_tea.text1": "为天地立心，为生民立命，为往圣继绝学，为万世开太平。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ender_flavor.text1": "天長地久有時盡，此恨綿綿無絕期",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.espresso.text1": "咖之精粹，品其本真。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.explosive_ginger_soup.text1": "南朝四百八十寺，多少樓台煙雨中。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.extremely_cold_condensed_milk_scented_tea.text1": "夜闌臥聽風吹雨，鐵馬冰河入夢來。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.fern_tea.text1": "薋菉葹以盈室兮，判独离而不服。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.fire_hibiscus_tea.text1": "無可奈何花落去，似曾相識燕歸來。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.flax_tea.text1": "硕鼠硕鼠，无食我黍！三岁贯女，莫我肯顾。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.flower_party.text1": "最是人間留不住，朱顏辭鏡花辭樹。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ginger_honey_black_tea.text1": "蒹葭蒼蒼，白露為霜，所謂伊人，在水一方。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ginger_milktea.text1": "姜辛暖腑，乳香怡神",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ginger_soup.text1": "新芽肌理腻，映日净如空。恰似匀妆指，柔梢带浅红。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.glow_berries_milktea.text1": "荧果甘冽，似有奇效",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.glow_berries_tea.text1": "银烛秋光冷画屏，轻罗小扇扑流萤。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.golden_soup.text1": "他強由他強，清風拂山崗，他橫任他橫，明月照大江！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.green_tea.text1": "關山難越，誰悲失路之人，萍水相逢，盡是他鄉之客",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.herbaceous_peony_tea.text1": "维士与女，伊其相谑，赠之以勺药。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.hibiscus_tea.text1": "松树千年终是朽，槿花一日自为荣。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.hkstyle_silkstocking.text1": "丝滑如缎，粤地风味",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.honeysuckle_tea.text1": "治疾及其未篤，除患貴其未深。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.horror_soup.text1": "白骨露於野，千裡無雞鳴。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.hot_cocoa.text1": "晚来天欲雪，能饮一杯无？",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ice_black_tea.text1": "冰魄玄茶",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.iced_americano.text1": "玄冰淬咖，伏暑良飲。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.jasmine_coffee.text1": "素馨清韻，滌煩靜心。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.jasmine_oolong_milktea.text1": "茉莉清雅，乌龙醇厚",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.jasmine_tea.text1": "应是仙娥宴归去，醉来掉下玉搔头。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.kudzu_soup.text1": "孟尝高洁，空余报国之情；阮籍猖狂，岂效穷途之哭！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.latte.text1": "乳香氤氳，徐徐補元。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lava_special_drink.text1": "更吹羌笛关山月，无那金闺万里愁。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lavender_milktea.text1": "薰衣安神，静心宁志",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lavender_tea.text1": "羌笛何須怨楊柳，春風不度玉門關",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.legendary_chinese_medicine.text1": "人生到處知何似，應似飛鴻踏雪泥",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.licorice_soup.text1": "焚膏油以繼晷，恆兀兀以窮年。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lilac_tea.text1": "芭蕉不展丁香结，同向春风各自愁。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lily_of_the_valley_tea.text1": "万里赴戎机，关山度若飞。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.lily_tea.text1": "秋风起兮白云飞，草木黄落兮雁南归。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.marigold_tea.text1": "云鬓花颜金步摇，芙蓉帐暖度春宵。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.milk_cap_milktea.text1": "浮沫绵密，余韵悠长",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.milk_mushroom_soup.text1": "安得廣廈千萬間，大庇天下寒士俱歡顏",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.mint_honey_special_drink.text1": "千山鳥飛絕，萬徑人蹤滅。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.mint_tea.text1": "寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.mixed_berry_smoothie.text1": "會挽雕弓如滿月，西北望，射天狼",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.mocha.text1": "朱髓濃郁，壯擊伐之力。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.nether_flavor.text1": "此去泉台招舊部，旌旗十萬斬閻羅",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.ocean_journey.text1": "春江潮水連海平，海上明月共潮生。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.oenothera_lindheimeri_phantom.text1": "落霞與孤鶩齊飛，秋水共長天一色",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.oenothera_tea.text1": "草木也知愁，韶华竟白头。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.oolong_apple_honey_special_drink.text1": "山不厭高，海不厭深，周公吐哺，天下歸心。 ",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.oolong_tea.text1": "同是天涯沦落人，相逢何必曾相识！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.oxeye_daisy_tea.text1": "待到秋来九月八，我花开后百花杀",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.peony_tea.text1": "云想衣裳花想容，春风拂槛露华浓.若非群玉山头见，会向瑶台月下逢。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.perilla_tea.text1": "风也萧萧，雨也萧萧，瘦尽灯花又一宵。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.poppy_tea.text1": "力拔山兮氣蓋世，時不利兮騅不逝，騅不逝兮可奈何，虞兮虞兮奈若何！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.poria_tea.text1": "老當益壯，寧毅白首之心？窮且益堅，不墜青雲之志。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.pudding_milktea.text1": "琼脂弹润，啜饮生欢",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.puer_tea.text1": "竹杖芒鞋轻胜马，谁怕？一蓑烟雨任平生。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.rose_apple_tea.text1": "南风知我意，吹梦到西洲。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.rose_blacktea_milktea.text1": "玫瑰沁脾，玄茶醒神",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.rose_tea.text1": "桃花人面各相红，不及天然玉作容。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.safflower_tea.text1": "莫道不销魂，帘卷西风，人比黄花瘦。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.scarlet_margarita.text1": "可憐無定河邊骨，犹是春闺梦里人！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.snow_lotus_tea.text1": "北国风光，千里冰封，万里雪飘。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.sparkling_matcha.text1": "醉後不知天在水，滿船清夢壓星河。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.spore_blossom_tea.text1": "挟飞仙以遨游，抱明月而长终。知不可乎骤得，托遗响于悲风。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.star_silver_potion.text1": "夜可视物，缓行不侵",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.storage_bag.auto_pickup": "自攝：%s",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.strong_mouth_mushroom_tea.text1": "人生自是有情痴，此恨不关风和月。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.supreme_golden_tea.text1": "鐘鼓饌玉不足貴，但願長醉不復醒",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.sweet_berries_tea.text1": "六月食郁及薁，七月亨葵及菽。八月剥枣，十月获稻。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.the_devils_call.text1": "日东月西兮徒相望，不得相随兮空断肠。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.the_evokers_wrath.text1": "蒼天已死，黃天當立，歲在甲子，天下大吉！",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.the_tide_is_coming.text1": "行到水窮處，坐看雲起時",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.traditional_milktea.text1": "古法精粹，醇厚绵长",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.triespresso.text1": "三煉成漿，慎飲毋貪。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.tulip_tea.text1": "路漫漫其修遠兮，吾將上下而求索",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.turtle_shell_lily_tea.text1": "醉臥沙場君莫笑，古來征戰幾人回。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.vanilla_milktea.text1": "香荚清幽，怡然自得",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.verbena_tea.text1": "今宵酒醒何处？杨柳岸，晓风残月。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.violet_milktea.text1": "紫堇幽香，摄人心魄",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.violet_tea.text1": "揽裙脱丝履，举身赴清池。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.watermelon_mint_special_drink.text1": "夕陽西下，斷腸人在天涯。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.white_daisy_tea.text1": "循花師古諭，熒魄鑄枯朽為生木。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.white_tea.text1": "山无陵，江水为竭，冬雷震震，夏雨雪，天地合，乃敢与君绝。",
  "tooltip.lushscentedparadise.wither_rose_tea.text1": "万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。"
}